{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "> ⚠️ **Aviso / Disclaimer**\n>\n> Este workbook é uma ferramenta **auxiliar e informativa** para inventário e posicionamento técnico de **SQL Server enabled by Azure Arc**. As informações são derivadas de Azure Resource Graph e dos recursos Azure Arc/SQL Server reportados no escopo selecionado.\n>\n> O workbook **não substitui** relatório oficial de licenciamento, fatura do Azure, Cost Management, EA/Volume Licensing, contratos vigentes, Product Terms ou validação do time de licenciamento Microsoft/LSP. Em caso de divergência, prevalecem as fontes oficiais e os contratos aplicáveis.\n>\n> Escopo do workbook: **SQL Server**. Não cobre licenciamento, ESU ou benefícios de Windows Server."
      },
      "name": "disclaimer",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "VisaoGeral"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "sub-arc-sql-0001",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "Subscription",
            "label": "Assinatura",
            "type": 6,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "includeAll": false,
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 86400000
            },
            "defaultValue": "value::all",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "rg-arc-sql-0002",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ResourceGroup",
            "label": "Grupo de Recursos",
            "type": 2,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "resources\n| where type =~ 'microsoft.hybridcompute/machines' or type =~ 'microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances' or type =~ 'microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions'\n| distinct resourceGroup\n| sort by resourceGroup asc",
            "crossComponentResources": [
              "{Subscription}"
            ],
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "defaultValue": "value::all",
            "queryType": 1,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills"
      },
      "name": "filters"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "selectedtab-default-0001",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "SelectedTab",
            "type": 1,
            "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
            "value": "VisaoGeral",
            "defaultValue": "VisaoGeral"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills"
      },
      "name": "selected_tab_default"
    },
    {
      "type": 11,
      "content": {
        "version": "LinkItem/1.0",
        "style": "tabs",
        "links": [
          {
            "id": "tab-visao-0001",
            "cellValue": "SelectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "📊 Visão Geral",
            "subTarget": "VisaoGeral",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "tab-lic-0002",
            "cellValue": "SelectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "🧾 Licenciamento SQL Server",
            "subTarget": "Licenciamento",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "tab-inv-0004",
            "cellValue": "SelectedTab",
            "linkTarget": "parameter",
            "linkLabel": "📋 Inventário SQL Server",
            "subTarget": "Inventario",
            "style": "link"
          },
          {
            "id": "tab-ref-0005",
            "cellValue": "SelectedTab",
