    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions\"\n| where properties.publisher =~ \"Microsoft.AzureData\"\n| where tostring(properties.type) in (\"WindowsAgent.SqlServer\", \"LinuxAgent.SqlServer\")\n| extend hostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(id, \"/extensions\")))\n| extend licenseTypeRaw = tostring(properties.settings.LicenseType)\n| extend esuRaw = tostring(properties.settings.enableExtendedSecurityUpdates)\n| extend pcoreRaw = tostring(properties.settings.UsePhysicalCoreLicense.IsApplied)\n| extend extState = tostring(properties.provisioningState)\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| project hostId, licenseTypeRaw, esuRaw, pcoreRaw, extState\n| join kind=inner (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n    | extend hostId = tolower(id)\n    | extend logicalCores = toint(properties.detectedProperties.logicalCoreCount)\n    | extend physicalCores = toint(properties.detectedProperties.coreCount)\n    | project hostId, machineName = name, logicalCores, physicalCores\n) on hostId\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances\"\n    | extend hostId = tolower(tostring(properties.containerResourceId))\n    | extend edition = tostring(properties.edition)\n    | extend instLicType = tostring(properties.licenseType)\n    | extend editionRank = case(edition has \"Enterprise\", 6, edition has \"Standard\", 5, edition has \"Web\", 4, edition has \"Express\", 3, edition has \"Developer\", 2, edition has \"Evaluation\", 1, 0)\n    | summarize topRank = max(editionRank), ativos = countif(instLicType !~ \"HADR\") by hostId\n) on hostId\n| extend topEdition = case(topRank == 6, \"Enterprise\", topRank == 5, \"Standard\", topRank == 4, \"Web\", topRank == 3, \"Express\", topRank == 2, \"Developer\", topRank == 1, \"Evaluation\", \"Sem instância\")\n| extend ed3 = case(topEdition == \"Enterprise\", \"Ent\", topEdition == \"Standard\", \"Std\", topEdition == \"Web\", \"Web\", topEdition == \"Express\", \"Exp\", topEdition)\n| extend isFreeEdition = topEdition in (\"Developer\", \"Evaluation\", \"Express\")\n| extend isPassivo = (topRank > 0 and ativos == 0)\n| extend coresDetectados = coalesce(logicalCores, physicalCores, 0)\n| extend coresHost = iff(coresDetectados < 4, 4, coresDetectados)\n| extend coresLicenca = case(topEdition == \"Sem instância\", 0, isFreeEdition, 0, isPassivo and licenseTypeRaw in (\"Paid\", \"PAYG\"), 0, isempty(licenseTypeRaw), 0, coresHost)\n| extend coresPAYG = iff(coresLicenca > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"PAYG\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresPaid = iff(coresLicenca > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"Paid\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresLicenseOnlyElegivel = iff(coresLicenca > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"LicenseOnly\", coresHost, 0)\n| extend coresRZero = case(isFreeEdition, coresHost, isPassivo and licenseTypeRaw in (\"Paid\", \"PAYG\"), coresHost, 0)\n| extend meterSku = case(topEdition == \"Sem instância\", \"Aguardando inventário SQL Server\", topEdition in (\"Developer\", \"Evaluation\"), strcat(topEdition, \" edition - R$ 0\"), topEdition == \"Express\", \"Express edition - R$ 0\", isPassivo and licenseTypeRaw in (\"Paid\", \"PAYG\"), strcat(ed3, \" edition - DR replica - R$ 0\"), isempty(licenseTypeRaw), \"Configuração pendente\", pcoreRaw =~ \"true\", strcat(ed3, \" edition - Virtual license\"), licenseTypeRaw == \"PAYG\", strcat(ed3, \" edition - PAYG\"), licenseTypeRaw == \"Paid\", strcat(ed3, \" edition - AHB\"), licenseTypeRaw == \"LicenseOnly\", strcat(ed3, \" edition - License only\"), \"-\")\n| extend estadoSQL = case(topEdition == \"Sem instância\", \"Sem instância\", isFreeEdition, \"Edição gratuita\", isPassivo and licenseTypeRaw in (\"Paid\", \"PAYG\"), \"Passivo HA/DR isento\", isPassivo, \"Passivo HA/DR sem benefício\", \"Ativo\")\n| extend sqlServerESU = case(esuRaw =~ \"true\", \"Habilitado\", licenseTypeRaw in (\"Paid\", \"PAYG\"), \"Elegível não habilitado\", \"Não elegível por LicenseType\")\n| extend extensaoSQL = case(extState =~ \"Succeeded\", \"OK\", extState =~ \"Failed\", \"Falha\", isempty(extState), \"Sem estado\", extState)\n| extend faturaAzure = case(topEdition == \"Sem instância\", \"-\", isempty(licenseTypeRaw), \"Pendente\", coresLicenca > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"PAYG\", \"PAYG - Azure cobra\", coresLicenca > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"Paid\", \"Paid/AHB - R$ 0 no Azure\", coresLicenca > 0 and licenseTypeRaw == \"LicenseOnly\", \"LicenseOnly - R$ 0 no Azure\", \"R$ 0\")\n| project Host = machineName, EdicaoSQL = topEdition, ExtensaoSQL = extensaoSQL, LicenseType = iff(isempty(licenseTypeRaw), \"Pendente\", licenseTypeRaw), EstadoSQL = estadoSQL, FaturaAzure = faturaAzure, MeterSKU = meterSku, CoresLicenca = coresLicenca, CoresHost = coresHost, SQLServerESU = sqlServerESU, PCore = iff(pcoreRaw =~ \"true\", \"p-core\", \"v-core\")\n| order by CoresLicenca desc, Host asc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "🧾 Posição de Licenciamento SQL Server por Host/OSE",
              "noDataMessage": "Nenhum host SQL Server enabled by Azure Arc com extensão SQL Server no escopo selecionado.",
              "noDataMessageStyle": 3,
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "gridSettings": {
                "filter": true,
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "CoresLicenca",
                    "formatter": 8,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "red"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "CoresHost",
                    "formatter": 8,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "blue"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "70",
            "name": "trueup_table"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Como ler a tabela\n\n**Host/OSE** é o servidor físico ou VM que hospeda uma ou mais instâncias SQL Server. O cálculo é por host, não por instância.\n\n| Campo | Leitura |\n| --- | --- |\n| **LicenseType** | `Paid`, `PAYG`, `LicenseOnly` ou pendente, vindo da extensão SQL Server |\n| **CoresLicenca** | cores do host considerados para licença SQL Server após regras de isenção |\n| **CoresHost** | `logicalCoreCount` ou `coreCount`, com mínimo de 4 |\n| **MeterSKU** | medidor projetado: PAYG, AHB, License only, DR replica, Virtual license ou R$ 0 |\n| **SQLServerESU** | status do Extended Security Updates do SQL Server, não Windows Server |\n\n**Importante:** `sqlVcores` do inventário é capacidade técnica por instância e pode somar várias instâncias no mesmo host. Use `CoresLicenca` para análise de true-up SQL Server."
            },
            "name": "trueup_legend",
            "customWidth": "30"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "trueup_detail",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "Licenciamento"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n## 📊 Capacidade Técnica das Instâncias SQL Server\n**Visão técnica de `properties.vCore` por instância SQL Server. Não representa fatura, AHB, PAYG, true-up ou ACR.**"
      },
      "name": "distribution_header",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "Inventario"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type == \"microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances\"\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| extend sqlEdition = tostring(properties.edition)\n| extend sqlVcores = toint(properties.vCore)\n| where isnotempty(sqlEdition)\n| summarize VCoreInstancias = sum(sqlVcores) by sqlEdition\n| order by VCoreInstancias desc",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "💻 vCores por edição SQL Server (instâncias)",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "sqlEdition",
                  "formatter": 1
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "VCoreInstancias",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "blue"
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": true,
                "size": "small"
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "vcores_by_edition"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions\"\n| where properties.publisher =~ \"Microsoft.AzureData\"\n| where tostring(properties.type) in (\"WindowsAgent.SqlServer\", \"LinuxAgent.SqlServer\")\n| extend hostId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(id, \"/extensions\")))\n| extend licenseTypeRaw = tostring(properties.settings.LicenseType)\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| join kind=leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances\"\n    | extend hostId = tolower(tostring(properties.containerResourceId))\n    | extend sqlVcores = toint(properties.vCore)\n    | project hostId, sqlVcores\n) on hostId\n| extend LicenseType = case(licenseTypeRaw == \"PAYG\", \"PAYG\", licenseTypeRaw == \"Paid\", \"Paid\", licenseTypeRaw == \"LicenseOnly\", \"LicenseOnly\", isempty(licenseTypeRaw), \"Pendente\", licenseTypeRaw)\n| summarize VCoreInstancias = sum(sqlVcores) by LicenseType\n| order by VCoreInstancias desc",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "💳 vCores por LicenseType (instâncias)",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "LicenseType",
                  "formatter": 1
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "VCoreInstancias",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "yellow"
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": true,
                "size": "small"
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "vcores_by_license"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "capacity_group",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "Inventario"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "---\n## 📋 Inventário Técnico de Instâncias SQL Server\n**Registro por instância para auditoria técnica de versão, edição, modelo SQL Server, LicenseType e SQL Server ESU.**"
      },
      "name": "inventory_header",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "Inventario"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "resources\n| where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines\"\n| extend arcStatus = case(tolower(properties.status) == 'connected', 'Connected', tolower(properties.status) == 'disconnected', 'Offline', tolower(properties.status) == 'error', 'Error', tolower(properties.status) == 'expired', 'Expired', 'Unknown')\n| extend joinId = tolower(id)\n| join kind = leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.azurearcdata/sqlserverinstances\"\n    | extend arcMachineId = tolower(tostring(properties.containerResourceId))\n    | extend sqlVersion = tostring(properties.version)\n    | extend sqlVcores = toint(properties.vCore)\n    | extend sqlEdition = tostring(properties.edition)\n    | extend sqlInstanceName = name\n    | extend sqlModel = tostring(properties.licenseType)\n    | project arcMachineId, sqlInstanceName, sqlVersion, sqlEdition, sqlVcores, sqlModel\n) on $left.joinId == $right.arcMachineId\n| join kind = leftouter (\n    resources\n    | where type == \"microsoft.hybridcompute/machines/extensions\"\n    | where properties.publisher =~ \"Microsoft.AzureData\"\n    | where tostring(properties.type) in (\"WindowsAgent.SqlServer\", \"LinuxAgent.SqlServer\")\n    | extend extMachineId = tolower(substring(id, 0, indexof(id, \"/extensions\")))\n    | extend licenseTypeRaw = tostring(properties.settings.LicenseType)\n    | extend esuRaw = tostring(properties.settings.enableExtendedSecurityUpdates)\n    | extend pcoreRaw = tostring(properties.settings.UsePhysicalCoreLicense.IsApplied)\n    | extend extStateRaw = tostring(properties.provisioningState)\n    | project extMachineId, licenseTypeRaw, esuRaw, pcoreRaw, extStateRaw\n) on $left.joinId == $right.extMachineId\n| where isnotempty(sqlVersion)\n| where resourceGroup in~ ({ResourceGroup})\n| extend LicenseTypeSQL = case(licenseTypeRaw == \"Paid\", \"Paid\", licenseTypeRaw == \"PAYG\", \"PAYG\", licenseTypeRaw == \"LicenseOnly\", \"LicenseOnly\", \"Pendente\")\n| extend SQLServerESU = case(esuRaw =~ \"true\", \"Habilitado\", licenseTypeRaw in (\"Paid\", \"PAYG\"), \"Elegível não habilitado\", \"Não elegível por LicenseType\")\n| extend PCore = iff(pcoreRaw =~ \"true\", \"p-core\", \"v-core\")\n| extend ExtensaoSQL = case(extStateRaw =~ \"Succeeded\", \"OK\", extStateRaw =~ \"Failed\", \"Falha\", isempty(extStateRaw), \"Sem extensão\", extStateRaw)\n| extend ModeloSQL = case(sqlModel =~ \"HADR\", \"HA/DR passivo\", sqlModel =~ \"ServerCAL\", \"Server+CAL\", sqlModel =~ \"PerCore\", \"Per-core\", sqlModel =~ \"Free\", \"Free/Eval/Express\", isempty(sqlModel), \"-\", sqlModel)\n| project Host = name, ArcStatus = arcStatus, ExtensaoSQL, InstanciaSQL = sqlInstanceName, VersaoSQL = sqlVersion, EdicaoSQL = sqlEdition, ModeloSQL, LicenseTypeSQL, SQLServerESU, PCore, vCoreInstancia = sqlVcores\n| order by Host asc",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "📋 Registro de Instâncias SQL Server enabled by Azure Arc",
              "noDataMessage": "Nenhuma instância SQL Server enabled by Azure Arc no escopo selecionado.",
              "noDataMessageStyle": 3,
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Subscription}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table",
              "gridSettings": {
                "filter": true,
                "sortBy": [
                  {
                    "itemKey": "Host",
                    "sortOrder": 1
                  }
                ],
                "formatters": [
                  {
                    "columnMatch": "vCoreInstancia",
                    "formatter": 8,
                    "formatOptions": {
                      "palette": "blue"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "70",
            "name": "inventory_table"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Guia de interpretação\n\n| Coluna | Significado |\n| --- | --- |\n| **Host** | servidor Arc que hospeda a instância SQL Server |\n| **ArcStatus** | estado do Arc-enabled server |\n| **ExtensaoSQL** | estado da extensão SQL Server (`Microsoft.AzureData`) |\n| **LicenseTypeSQL** | `Paid`, `PAYG`, `LicenseOnly` ou pendente |\n| **SQLServerESU** | Extended Security Updates do SQL Server |\n| **vCoreInstancia** | capacidade técnica da instância, não base de true-up |\n\n**Ação prática:** validar `ExtensaoSQL != OK`, `LicenseTypeSQL = Pendente` e `LicenseOnly` em hosts com edições Standard/Enterprise."
            },
            "name": "inventory_legend",
            "customWidth": "30"
          }
        ]
      },
      "name": "inventory_group",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "Inventario"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 📚 Referências oficiais e escopo\n\n### Documentação pública Microsoft\n- **Manage licensing and billing of SQL Server enabled by Azure Arc**: referência para LicenseType, billing, PAYG, Paid/AHB, License only, v-core, p-core e virtualização ilimitada.\n- **SQL Server Extended Security Updates enabled by Azure Arc**: referência para SQL Server ESU e faturamento de ESU do SQL Server.\n- **Configure SQL Server enabled by Azure Arc**: referência para configuração de SQL Server enabled by Azure Arc, incluindo SQL Server ESU em escala.\n- **Azure Workbooks data sources**: referência para uso de Azure Resource Graph como fonte de dados em workbooks.\n\n### Escopo explícito deste workbook\nEste workbook cobre exclusivamente **SQL Server enabled by Azure Arc**. Não cobre Windows Server ESU, Windows Server licensing, Windows Server Azure Hybrid Benefit ou inventário de licenciamento de sistema operacional."
      },
      "name": "references",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "Referencias"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "### Change Log\n\n| Version | Date | Description | Author |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| v1.8.0 | Agosto 2026 | Alinhamento terminológico 100% SQL Server: remoção de referências a Windows Server ESU/licenciamento; `SA SQL` renomeado para **LicenseType Paid**; `ESU SQL` renomeado para **SQL Server ESU**; `Cores AHB` renomeado para **Cores com Azure Hybrid Benefit (Paid)**; KPI **LicenseOnly elegível** passa a excluir edições gratuitas; adicionado KPI **Cores licenciáveis SQL** na Visão Geral; textos atualizados conforme documentação pública de SQL Server enabled by Azure Arc. | Fabio Rodrigues Vieira Costa - CSA Azure Infra |"
      },
      "name": "changelog",
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "Changelog"
      }
    }
  ],
  "defaultResourceIds": [
    "/subscriptions"
  ],
  "$schema": "https://github.com/Microsoft/Application-Insights-Workbooks/blob/master/schema/workbook.json",
  "layout": {
    "type": "flow"
  },
  "fallbackResourceIds": [
    "Azure Monitor"
  ]
}
